WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.210
Genesis says God created
humans in his own image:

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.000
male and female he created them.

3
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:12.340
Yet a New Testament letter says:
Wives, be subject to your own husbands.

4
00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:15.520
The same passage tells
husbands to love their wives,

5
00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.160
as Christ loved the Church
and gave himself up for her.

6
00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.360
Christians share these verses.

7
00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.820
So do they agree on what they mean?

8
00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.210
In this mission, you'll
read Ephesians 5 closely,

9
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.910
one verse at a time.

10
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.230
Then you'll meet what Catholics, Orthodox
Christians and Quakers teach about the

11
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.320
roles of men and women.

12
00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:39.810
Your mission: find out whether Christians
agree on what it means for wives to

13
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.480
submit to their husbands.
